PalletTown_Ranch_Text_Hand1Strike::
	.string "The east fence was cut this morning.\n"
	.string "On a ranch this big, no one saw.$"

PalletTown_Ranch_Text_Hand1::
	.string "This ranch runs from the town wall\n"
	.string "to the far fences. It takes ten of\n"
	.string "us to look after it all.$"

PalletTown_Ranch_Text_Hand2Strike::
	.string "They took the tracker POKéMON from\n"
	.string "the pens. The fence was cut open.$"

PalletTown_Ranch_Text_Hand2::
	.string "The east pasture is so far out, we\n"
	.string "only check it twice a day.$"

PalletTown_Ranch_Text_Girl::
	.string "I came to help, but I got lost\n"
	.string "twice. The ranch is HUGE!$"

PalletTown_Ranch_Text_Slowpoke::
	.string "SLOWPOKE: ...Yawn.$"

PalletTown_Ranch_Text_Psyduck::
	.string "PSYDUCK: Gwaa?\n"
	.string "It looks like it has a headache.$"

PalletTown_Ranch_Text_Hand3::
	.string "The pens were shut tight this morning.\n"
	.string "Now look at this fence...$"

PalletTown_Ranch_Text_Doduo::
	.string "DODUO: Kwek! Kwek!\n"
	.string "Its two heads argue about the hay.$"

PalletTown_Ranch_Text_Nidoranm::
	.string "NIDORAN: Gyuu!\n"
	.string "Its ears twitch at every sound.$"

PalletTown_Ranch_Text_Nidoranf::
	.string "NIDORAN: Kyuu!\n"
	.string "It nibbles the garnet-dusted grass.$"

PalletTown_Ranch_Text_Meowth::
	.string "MEOWTH: Nyaa!\n"
	.string "It keeps the barn free of mice.$"

PalletTown_Ranch_Text_Jigglypuff::
	.string "JIGGLYPUFF: Jiggly...\n"
	.string "It hums softly to the other animals.$"

PalletTown_Ranch_Text_BarnDoor::
	.string "The barn door is bolted shut.\n"
	.string "Feed and tools are stored inside.$"

PalletTown_Ranch_Text_Hand1Reward::
	.string "DODUO and both NIDORAN just trotted\n"
	.string "back into the pens, safe!\p"
	.string "The boss says you found them on the\n"
	.string "road. Please, take these.$"

PalletTown_Ranch_Text_ReceivedPotion::
	.string "{PLAYER} received a POTION!$"

PalletTown_Ranch_Text_ReceivedBalls::
	.string "{PLAYER} received five POKé BALLS!$"

PalletTown_Ranch_Text_Hand1Reward2::
	.string "The boss says it is the least we can\n"
	.string "do. Take care of them out there.$"

PalletTown_Ranch_Text_Hand1Thanks::
	.string "The animals are calm again.\n"
	.string "Thank you for everything.$"
